# Formatting rules (docs/conventions.md). Only the differences from LLVM style are listed so the
# file parses with clang-format 18 and newer; CI runs 20, developers run whatever they have.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
AllowShortEnumsOnASingleLine: false
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
ColumnLimit: 120
